        "content": "\n**`src/llm/client.py` — 0% tested**\n- `_safe_text()` — blocked-content path\n- `GeminiClient.__init__` — missing API key → `RuntimeError`\n- `GeminiClient._generate` — semaphore, retry on `ResourceExhausted`, exhausted retries\n- `GeminiClient.chat` / `stream_chat` / `chat_parsed` — all paths\n- `get_client()` singleton\n\n**`src/agents/orchestrator.py` — 0% tested**\n- `OrchestratorAgent._build_synthesis_prompt` — prompt construction\n- `OrchestratorAgent._aggregate_citations` — deduplication across agents\n- `OrchestratorAgent.process` — JSON parse success, `json.JSONDecodeError` fallback\n- `OrchestratorAgent._route` — valid JSON, malformed JSON fallback (all-agents default)\n- `OrchestratorAgent.process_with_streaming` — status callbacks, specialist errors\n\n**`src/agents/specialist.py` — 0% tested**\n- `SpecialistAgent._load_instruments` — filters registry by `agent_id`\n- `SpecialistAgent._build_policy_context` — empty vs non-empty fetched list\n- `SpecialistAgent._parse_response` — valid JSON, parse failure fallback\n- `SpecialistAgent.process_with_fetch` — no engine, engine with fetch failures, all-fail\n\n**`src/fetch/engine.py` — partially tested**\n- `FetchEngine._normalize_url` — laws-lois rewrite and no-op cases\n- `FetchEngine._get_domain` — normal URL, malformed URL\n- `FetchEngine._do_fetch` — cache hit, cache miss + HTTP success, HTTP failure + stale, HTTP failure + no stale → `FetchError`\n- `FetchEngine.fetch_batch` — mixed success/failure\n- `FetchEngine.close` / `cleanup_fetch_engine`\n\n**`src/fetch/cache.py` — 0% tested**\n- `CacheEntry.content_hash`, `is_valid`, `expires_at`\n- `FetchCache.get` — hit, miss\n- `FetchCache.get_stale` — hit, miss\n- `FetchCache.set_cached` / `store`\n- `FetchCache._get_default_ttl` — legislation domain, collective domain, default\n- `FetchCache.clear_expired`\n- `FetchCache.health_check` — normal, exception path\n\n**`src/data/db.py` — partially tested**\n- `save_agent_response` / `get_agent_responses`\n- `save_orchestrator_response` / `get_orchestrator_response`\n- `save_feedback` / `get_feedback_for_query` / `export_feedback`\n- `get_cached` / `get_stale` / `set_cached` / `clear_expired`\n- `list_queries` — empty DB and with records\n\n**`src/fetch/extractors.py` — partially tested**\n- `_load_selectors` — file not found fallback\n- `_get_selectors` — domain match, default fallback\n- `_remove_elements` — nav/header removal\n- `_format_content` — headings, paragraphs, lists, nested divs\n- `_clean_text` / `_truncate` — at-limit, under-limit\n- `extract` — exception path returning raw text\n\n**`src/api/routes.py` — 0% tested**\n- `health_check`, `list_agents`, `list_queries`, `get_query` (404 + 200), `submit_feedback`, `export_feedback`\n\n**`src/api/websocket.py` — 0% tested**\n- `WebSocketManager.connect/disconnect/send/broadcast_error`\n- `process_query` — success, error, `WebSocketDisconnect`\n- `websocket_endpoint` — full WS handshake\n\n---\n\n",
